## Available Indicators Reference

When reading pattern entry/exit conditions, these are the indicators used:

### Oscillators (Momentum/Mean Reversion)
| Indicator | Range | Meaning |
|-----------|-------|---------|
| rsi14 | 0-100 | RSI 14-period. <30 oversold, >70 overbought |
| stochasticK | 0-100 | Stochastic %K. <20 oversold, >80 overbought |
| stochasticD | 0-100 | Stochastic %D (SMA of %K) |
| momentum1, momentum5, momentum10 | % | Price momentum over N periods |

### MACD (Trend/Momentum)
| Indicator | Range | Meaning |
|-----------|-------|---------|
| macdLine | any | MACD = EMA(12) - EMA(26). Positive = bullish |
| macdSignal | any | Signal line = EMA(9) of MACD |
| macdHistogram | any | MACD - Signal. Rising = strengthening |

### Trend Strength
| Indicator | Range | Meaning |
|-----------|-------|---------|
| adx14 | 0-100 | Trend strength. >25 trending, <20 ranging |
| atr14 | >0 | Average True Range (volatility measure) |

### Bollinger Bands
| Indicator | Range | Meaning |
|-----------|-------|---------|
| bollingerPercentB | 0-1 | Price position (0=lower band, 0.5=middle, 1=upper) |
| bollingerBandwidth | >0 | Band width. <10 = squeeze (low volatility) |

### Moving Averages
| Indicator | Range | Meaning |
|-----------|-------|---------|
| sma10, sma20, sma50, sma200 | >0 | Simple moving averages |
| ema12, ema26 | >0 | Exponential moving averages |
| priceVsSma10Pct | % | Distance from SMA10 (positive = above) |
| priceVsSma50Pct | % | Distance from SMA50 |
| priceVsSma200Pct | % | Distance from SMA200 |

### Volume
| Indicator | Range | Meaning |
|-----------|-------|---------|
| volumeRatio | >0 | Current volume / 20-period avg. >2 = spike |

### Boolean Flags (1 = true, 0 = false)

**RSI Zones:**
- rsiOversold (RSI < 30), rsiOverbought (RSI > 70)

**Stochastic Zones:**
- stochOversold (%K < 20), stochOverbought (%K > 80)

**MACD Signals:**
- macdBullishCross (crossed above signal), macdBearishCross (crossed below)
- macdPositive (MACD line > 0)

**Bollinger Bands:**
- bbSqueeze (bandwidth < 10), bbAtLower (%B < 0.1), bbAtUpper (%B > 0.9)

**Moving Average Position:**
- aboveSma10, aboveSma50, aboveSma200 (price above MA)
- goldenCross (50 crossed above 200), deathCross (50 crossed below 200)

**Trend Direction:**
- strongTrend (ADX > 25), weakTrend (ADX < 20)
- trendingUp (price making higher highs), trendingDown (lower lows)

**Volume:**
- volumeSpike (ratio > 2), volumeDry (ratio < 0.5)

**Momentum:**
- momentumPositive (momentum > 0), momentumStrong (momentum > 2%)

### Temporal Indicators
| Indicator | Values | Meaning |
|-----------|--------|---------|
| dayOfWeek | 0-6 | 0=Sunday, 1=Monday, ..., 6=Saturday |
| hourOfDay | 0-23 | UTC hour |
| isWeekend, isMonday, isFriday | 0/1 | Day flags |
| isUSMarketHours | 0/1 | 9:30-16:00 EST |
| isAsianSession | 0/1 | Tokyo session |
| isEuropeanSession | 0/1 | London session |

